Th97tJbHtOPE8qDqMjgWI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGiCBL_jRDEMsVEP-DhyuOegR5hJ1TVaig3yEYq5g-Mbw&oe=6A8ED225"}, {"file_name": "a3b785f994d24530b38266765446efe4_resize.png", "id": "1358605802306457", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823940_1358605805639790_7874766647138728701_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fkTkjQWEhVEQ7kNvwGGR66z&_nc_oc=AdpMG-SznlsDgs_bD2ovCxGkQSRa8JfvQNSaplHvwI1_JJ0WdWGu0vhe2vl7nwBXZwg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH-UgHW4tWmO8eRiRIlbKSn2EefKPdMM7q_nsBtAFjEZw&oe=6A8EE07E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Moon Invaders FPV", "keywords": ["Moon", "Invaders", "Retro", "FPV", "Space"], "long_description": "The Moon has been occupied, fortified and turned into a launch point for invasion. Your mission is simple: enter the enemy complex and clear it out.\n\nPilot a fast, heavily armed spacecraft across cratered lunar terrain, attacking surface defences and searching for entrances into the underground network. Descend into twisting tunnels, enormous caverns, mining facilities and hostile bases packed with gun emplacements, missile batteries, drones and enemy fighters.\n\nFly freely in every direction as you navigate tight passages, hidden chambers and branching routes. Destroy generators, reactors, communications arrays and command centres to disable each sector. Collect fuel, shields, ammunition and weapon upgrades to survive increasingly powerful defences.\n\nEvery installation is a combat puzzle. Some targets protect sealed routes, power defensive barriers or reinforce nearby enemies. Choose your path, manage your resources and decide whether to press deeper or search for valuable hidden areas.\n\nComplete the primary objective and the battle is not over. Reactors overload, caverns begin to collapse and damaged tunnels become deadly obstacles as you race back towards the surface.\n\nEnter the complex. Destroy everything. Get out alive.", "short_description": "Pilot a combat ship across the Moon\u2019s surface and descend into vast tunnels, caverns and enemy installations. Destroy gun emplacements, fighters, reactors and command systems, collect upgrades, uncover hidden routes and escape before the underground complex collapses. Descend. Destroy. Escape.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.saxcompute.ltd/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Sax Compute Ltd", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.saxcompute.ltd/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1592192974313489"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1585215279638692"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1652513535843782"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1652513535843782"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1785438600, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1652513535843782"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1601186618041558", "version": "1.16"}, "id": "1251548680315120", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1585215269638693", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1601186618041558"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1251548680315120"}]}, "change_log": "## 1.16 - 9 August 2026\n\n### Microsoft Store release\n\n- Added a dedicated Microsoft Store build profile and release path for Windows\n  x64 PCVR.\n- Added Microsoft Store licence validation using the packaged MSIX identity and\n  a native x64 Store licence bridge.\n- Added clear start-menu states for Store installation, ownership and temporary\n  licence-service failures.\n- Added automated staging, MSIX creation, manifest validation, package\n  inspection and SHA-256 generation for Store submissions.\n- Added Microsoft Store artwork and package metadata for Moon Invaders FPV.\n\n### Unified release builds\n\n- Added one PowerShell command to build Local Windows, Microsoft Store MSIX,\n  Meta Quest PCVR and Meta Quest standalone releases in sequence.\n- Added a build-version parameter that accepts versions such as `1.16`, applies\n  `1.16.0` to every selected build profile and advances the Android version code\n  to `116`.\n- Added separate logs and a final result summary for every platform build.\n- Improved unattended build handling with stale Unity lock detection, clean\n  output locations and suppressed Explorer popups.\n- Made Microsoft Store packaging use the active Store profile version so its\n  player marker and MSIX manifest remain aligned.\n\n### Compatibility and interface\n\n- Restored the original Meta Quest package name,\n  `com.yourname.vectorskiesvr`, so updates remain compatible with the existing\n  Quest Store application.\n- Repositioned the cockpit score display for Windows monitor mode so it remains\n  visible above the cockpit status bar.\n- Corrected the start-menu title to `Moon Invaders FPV`.\n- Kept the standalone Windows build free of Microsoft Store licence checks.\n\n### Project migration\n\n- Renamed the legacy `CreateRunner` asset tree, runtime namespace, flight-system\n  prefab and editor automation to `MoonInvaders` while preserving Unity asset\n  references.\n- Updated scene components, build validators and setup tools to use the renamed\n  Moon Invaders paths and types.\n\n### Release targets\n\n- Application and build-profile version: `1.15.0`\n- Android bundle version code: `115`\n- Meta Quest package name: `com.yourname.vectorskiesvr`\n- Targets: Local Windows, Microsoft Store PCVR, Meta Quest PCVR and Meta Quest\n  standalone\n- Windows and Android scripting backend: IL2CPP\n", "created_date": 1786283427, "id": "1601186618041558", "version": "1.16", "version_code": 116, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1585215269638693", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1601186618041558"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1251548680315120"}]}, "change_log": "## 1.9 \u2014 3 August 2026\n\n### Completed cavern encounters\n\n- Completed the cavern encounter setup across the MoonScape cavern network.\n- Configured the cavern entrance triggers, enemy spawn areas and missile\n  emplacements for the completed encounters.\n- Added numbered cavern gun groups so every gun assigned to the active cavern\n  starts targeting the player immediately when its entrance triggers are met.\n- Made all guns in that cavern stop targeting and firing immediately when the\n  player leaves through the cavern triggers.\n- Kept tunnel and surface guns on the existing cone-based targeting system and\n  its four-gun targeting limit.\n- Carries forward the completed tunnel routes, aligned internal obstacle volumes\n  and protected Tunnel 3 artifact placements from version 1.8.", "created_date": 1785787663, "id": "1596278228532397", "version": "0.1.10", "version_code": 110, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1585215269638693", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1601186618041558"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1251548680315120"}]}, "change_log": "## 1.9 \u2014 2 August 2026\n\n### Release refresh\n\n- Promoted the completed MoonScape tunnel-network build to version 1.9.\n- Carries forward the finalized tunnel routes, aligned internal obstacle volumes\n  and protected Tunnel 3 artifact placements from version 1.8.\n- This release contains no additional gameplay or content changes beyond 1.8.\n- Fixed Cavern", "created_date": 1785700597, "id": "1595423101951243", "version": "0.1.9", "version_code": 19, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1585215269638693", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1601186618041558"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1251548680315120"}]}, "change_log": "## 1.8 \u2014 2 August 2026\n\n### Completed tunnel network\n\n- Repositioned and reoriented the remaining MoonScape tunnel sections to\n  complete their routes through the lunar terrain.\n- Resized and aligned the tunnels' internal obstacle volumes to fit the\n  finalized geometry more accurately.\n- Marked the completed tunnel sections in the scene and protected the finalized\n  Tunnel 3 sections from automated artifact replacement.", "created_date": 1785677361, "id": "1595168911976662", "version": "0.1.8", "version_code": 18, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1585215269638693", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1601186618041558"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1251548680315120"}]}, "change_log": "## 1.7 \u2014 1 August 2026\n\n### Tunnel layout\n\n- Repositioned and reoriented the first three MoonScape tunnel sections to\n  improve their route through the lunar terrain.\n- Adjusted the tunnel obstacle volumes to match the revised tunnel geometry.\n\n### Controller strafe stability\n\n- Prevented head turns from producing unintended lateral ship drift by measuring\n  strafe from the controller's calibrated tracking-origin position.\n- Added development-build diagnostics for controller displacement, headset\n  displacement, headset yaw and the previous head-relative strafe signal.\n\n### Release target\n\n- Application version: `0.1.7`\n- Android bundle version code: `17`\n- Primary target: Meta Quest / Android", "created_date": 1785616686, "id": "1594592802034273", "version": "0.1.7", "version_code": 17, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}